## Investigation commands

```sql
SELECT id, name, code, program_id, active FROM op_course ORDER BY id;
SELECT active, COUNT(*) FROM op_course GROUP BY active;
SELECT p.id, p.name, COUNT(c.id) AS courses
FROM op_program p
LEFT JOIN op_course c ON c.program_id = p.id AND COALESCE(c.active, true)
GROUP BY p.id, p.name;
```

